  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AERC Core support 2018/2019 - 2022/2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to AERC : Research support contributing to economic policies for inclusive and sustainable development in Africa. AERC covers more than 40 countries in sub-Saharan Africa, whereby most publications are produced in Nigeria, Ghana, Kenya, and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
